---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
---

<Base
  title="Privacy — AutoLog"
  description="Where your data lives, the two requests the app makes, and what it never does."
>
  <div class="page-column">
    <div class="block head">
      <h1>Privacy</h1>
      <p class="microlabel effective">Effective 2026-08-22</p>
    </div>

    <section class="block">
      <h2>Where your data lives</h2>
      <p>
        Trips, stats, and everything the app knows about your car are
        stored on your phone. There is no account, no sign-in, no
        analytics, and no AutoLog server. Delete the app and the data goes
        with it.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="block">
      <h2>The two requests the app makes</h2>
      <p>
        Both are best effort and silent. When they fail, the app skips
        them and moves on.
      </p>

      <div class="panel request-panel">
        <p class="microlabel request-label">VIN decode</p>
        <p>
          Your VIN is sent once to the NHTSA vPIC API, a US government
          service, to identify the car's make, model, and year. Nothing
          else is attached to the request.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="panel request-panel">
        <p class="microlabel request-label">Road geometry</p>
        <p>
          After a trip, the bounding box of the trip's area is sent to the
          Overpass API, an OpenStreetMap service, to fetch road shapes and
          names. The route you drove stays on the phone.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="block">
      <h2>What the app never does</h2>
      <p>
        It never uploads a route, never sells or shares driving data, and
        never scores your driving. There is no third party code in the
        app at all.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="block block--last">
      <h2>Questions</h2>
      <p>Write to the engineer and you will get an answer.</p>
      <!-- TODO: dedicated address -->
      <p class="contact-email">hello@&hellip;</p>
    </section>
  </div>
</Base>

<style>
  .page-column {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    padding: 100px 24px 60px;
  }

  .block {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 14px;
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 680px;
    padding-bottom: 44px;
  }

  .block--last {
    padding-bottom: 0;
  }

  .head {
    padding-bottom: 52px;
  }

  .head h1 {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-weight: 500;
    font-size: 44px;
    letter-spacing: var(--tracking-display);
    color: var(--text-primary);
  }

  .effective {
    font-size: 10px;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: var(--text-muted);
  }

  .block h2 {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-weight: 500;
    font-size: 22px;
    letter-spacing: -0.015em;
    color: var(--text-primary);
  }

  .block p {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 15.5px;
    line-height: 25px;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
  }

  .request-panel {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 10px;
    padding: 20px 24px;
  }

  .request-label {
    font-size: 9.5px;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: var(--color-amber);
  }

  .request-panel p {
    font-size: 15px;
    line-height: 24px;
    color: rgba(var(--color-bone-rgb), 0.6);
  }

  .contact-email {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 13px;
    color: var(--text-muted);
  }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .page-column {
      padding: 64px 24px 40px;
    }

    .block {
      gap: 12px;
      padding-bottom: 36px;
    }

    .head {
      padding-bottom: 40px;
    }

    .head h1 {
      font-size: 34px;
    }

    .effective {
      font-size: 9.5px;
    }

    .block h2 {
      font-size: 19px;
    }

    .block p {
      font-size: 14.5px;
      line-height: 23px;
    }

    .request-panel {
      gap: 8px;
      padding: 16px 18px;
    }

    .request-label {
      font-size: 9px;
    }

    .request-panel p {
      font-size: 14px;
      line-height: 22px;
    }
  }
</style>
